{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Joel Bille and band Bortre Rymden\u2019s soundtrack for The Midnight Walk feels as handmade as the game\u2019s clay world. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rooted in Scandinavian folk with a surreal twist, their music swaps typical orchestras for something more intimate and haunting. Clarinets, saxophones, violins, and raw, earthy drums echo through the landscapes - creating a soundscape that feels both mystical and down to earth. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The band ranging from 4-5 members brings a deeply human and profound voice to the game\u2019s emotional journey. It\u2019s a musical game that relies heavily on Joel Bille\u2019s compositions and the track \u201cGr\u00e4ns\u201d is a journey in its own right, celebrated by fans.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4002560?t=1757928033","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4002560?t=1757928033","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4002560/18b16c0cab5156b020ee08aeb40e4698404f2959/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757928033","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4002560/18b16c0cab5156b020ee08aeb40e4698404f2959/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757928033","content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Joel Bille and band Bortre Rymden\u2019s soundtrack for The Midnight Walk feels as handmade as the game\u2019s clay world. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rooted in Scandinavian folk with a surreal twist, their music swaps typical orchestras for something more intimate and haunting. Clarinets, saxophones, violins, and raw, earthy drums echo through the landscapes - creating a soundscape that feels both mystical and down to earth. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The band ranging from 4-5 members brings a deeply human and profound voice to the game\u2019s emot